          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso: Address",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>\n<p>With the will of [Go]d the exalted,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>may it arrive in Cairo the well-protected and be delivered soundly to the mighty hand of our dear friend Mu\u02bfallim Ibra\u0304hi\u0304m \u02bfA\u0304da\u0304h,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>the coral merchant.</p>\n</li></ol>\n",
